{"title":"Career Roadmap · Medical Writer","role":"Medical Writer","summary":"A Medical Writer creates accurate, evidence-based medical and healthcare content for pharmaceutical companies, biotechnology companies, hospitals, medical-communication agencies, research organizations, journals, healthcare technology companies, and public-health organizations.","facts":{"Current degree":"MBBS (Bachelor of Medicine & Bachelor of Surgery)","Course":"MBBS"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Medical Writer creates accurate, evidence-based medical and healthcare content for pharmaceutical companies, biotechnology companies, hospitals, medical-communication agencies, research organizations, journals, healthcare technology companies, and public-health organizations."},{"type":"p","text":"An MBBS graduate has a strong advantage because medical writing requires the ability to understand clinical concepts, disease mechanisms, diagnosis, treatment, clinical evidence, medical terminology, and scientific literature."},{"type":"h","text":"Medical writers may work on:"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical trial documents"},{"type":"h","text":"Scientific publications"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical education materials"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient education"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory documents"},{"type":"h","text":"Drug information"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical articles"},{"type":"h","text":"Research summaries"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical study reports"},{"type":"h","text":"Investigator brochures"},{"type":"h","text":"Systematic literature summaries"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical websites"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare content"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical communication campaigns"},{"type":"h","text":"Continuing Medical Education (CME) materials"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmaceutical promotional/non-promotional content"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical scripts and videos"},{"type":"h","text":"Important di