formed consent"},{"type":"h","text":"Evidence-based medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"High-value activities"},{"type":"h","text":"Participate in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical research projects"},{"type":"h","text":"Case reports"},{"type":"h","text":"Journal clubs"},{"type":"h","text":"Research papers"},{"type":"h","text":"Literature reviews"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical audits"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical studies"},{"type":"h","text":"Academic presentations"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong MBBS student can begin building a medical writing portfolio alongside clinical training."}]},{"heading":"Core Medical Writer Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill Area","Required Capability"],"rows":[[{"text":"Medical Knowledge"},{"text":"Strong clinical understanding"}],[{"text":"Scientific Writing"},{"text":"Clear evidence-based writing"}],[{"text":"Literature Review"},{"text":"Finding and evaluating research"}],[{"text":"Evidence-Based Medicine"},{"text":"Understanding levels of evidence"}],[{"text":"Clinical Research"},{"text":"Study design and interpretation"}],[{"text":"Pharmacology"},{"text":"Drugs, mechanisms and safety"}],[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Basic clinical statistics"}],[{"text":"Biostatistics"},{"text":"Understanding research results"}],[{"text":"Medical Terminology"},{"text":"Professional terminology"}],[{"text":"Editing"},{"text":"Accuracy and clarity"}],[{"text":"Referencing"},{"text":"Proper scientific citations"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Explaining complex concepts"}],[{"text":"Regulatory Awareness"},{"text":"Clinical/regulatory documentation"}],[{"text":"Digital Skills"},{"text":"Research and document tools"}],[{"text":"AI Literacy"},{"text":"AI-assisted research and drafting"}]]}]},{"heading":"Medical Literature Research","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"One of the most important skills is learning how to find trustworthy medical evidence."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical sources"},{"type":"h","text":"Peer-reviewed journals"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical guidelines"},{"type":"h","text":"Systematic reviews"},{"type":"h","text":"Meta-analyses"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical trial publications"},{"type":"h","text":"Government health agencies"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional medical organizations"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory publications"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical trial registries"},{"type":"h","text":"Research workflow"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Question"},{"type":"h","text":"Define Search Strategy"},{"type":"h","text":"Search Scientific Literature"},{"type":"h","text":"Screen Relevant Sources"},{"type":"h","text":"Evaluate Evidence Quality"},{"type":"h","text":"Extract Findings"},{"type":"h","text":"Synthesize Evidence"},{"type":"h","text":"Draft Content"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Review"},{"type":"h","text":"Scientific/Editorial Review"},{"type":"h","text":"Final Publication"}]},{"heading":"Scientific Writing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Learn to write:"},{"type":"h","text":"Abstracts"},{"type":"h","text":"Case reports"},{"type":"h","text":"Review articles"},{"type":"h","text":"Research summaries"},{"type":"h","text":"Manuscripts"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical articles"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical education content"},{"type":"h","text":"Scientific presentations"},{"type":"h","text":"Posters"},{"type":"h","text":"Conference abstracts"},{"type":"h","text":"Literature reviews"},{"type":"h","text":"Scientific writing principles"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong medical writer should prioritize:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Accuracy","Evidence","Clarity","Structure","Consistency"]},{"type":"h","text":"Avoid:"},{"type":"h","text":"Unsupported medical claims"},{"type":"h","text":"Overgeneralization"},{"type":"h","text":"Sensational language"},{"type":"h","text":"Misinterpretation of studies"},{"type":"h","text":"Unverified treatment claims"},{"type":"h","text":"Copying published material"},{"type":"h","text":"Incorrect citations"}]},{"heading":"Clinical Research Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A medical writer should understand how clinical studies work."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical trial phases"},{"type":"h","text":"Protocols"},{"type":"h","text":"Randomization"},{"type":"h","text":"Blinding"},{"type":"h","text":"Control groups"},{"type":"h","text":"Inclusion criteria"},{"type":"h","text":"Exclusion criteria"},{"type":"h","text":"Endpoints"},{"type":"h","text":"Primary outcomes"},{"type":"h","text":"Secondary outcomes"},{"type":"h","text":"Safety outcomes"},{"type":"h","text":"Adverse events"},{"type":"h","text":"Statistical significance"},{"type":"h","text":"Confidence intervals"},{"type":"h","text":"Effect size"},{"type":"h","text":"Study limitations"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical trial pathway"},{"type":"h","text":"Research Question"},{"type":"h","text":"Study Protocol"},{"type":"h","text":"Ethics / Regulatory Review"},{"type":"h","text":"Participant Recruitment"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Collection"},{"type":"h","text":"Statistical Analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Interpretation"},{"type":"h","text":"Study Report"},{"type":"h","text":"Publication / Submission"}]},{"heading":"Regulatory Medical Writing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the strongest career specializations for an MBBS graduate."},{"type":"p","text":"Regulatory writers may work on documents associated with:"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical development"},{"type":"h","text":"Drug development"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical trials"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory submissions"},{"type":"h","text":"Safety documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical product approvals"},{"type":"h","text":"Potential document types include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Study Reports"},{"type":"h","text":"Investigator Brochures"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical summaries"},{"type":"h","text":"Protocol-related documents"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient information materials"},{"type":"h","text":"Safety narratives"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory submission components"},{"type":"p","text":"The exact documentation depends on the organization, product and applicable regulatory framework."}]},{"heading":"Medical Communications","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Medical communications is another major career route."},{"type":"h","text":"Possible work:"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical education"},{"type":"h","text":"Scientific presentations"},{"type":"h","text":"Congress materials"},{"type":"h","text":"Speaker materials"},{"type":"h","text":"Advisory-board content"},{"type":"h","text":"Scientific slide decks"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical newsletters"},{"type":"h","text":"Educational videos"},{"type":"h","text":"Disease-awareness campaigns"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare professional materials"},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"A pharmaceutical company launches a new therapy."},{"type":"h","text":"The medical writer may help create:"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Evidence"},{"type":"h","text":"Scientific Summary"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Slide Deck"},{"type":"h","text":"HCP Educational Material"},{"type":"h","text":"Congress Poster"},{"type":"h","text":"Publication Support"}]},{"heading":"Patient Education Writing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An MBBS graduate can also specialize in communicating medical information to patients."},{"type":"h","text":"Topics include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Diabetes"},{"type":"h","text":"Hypertension"},{"type":"h","text":"Cancer"},{"type":"h","text":"Heart disease"},{"type":"h","text":"Mental health"},{"type":"h","text":"Women's health"},{"type":"h","text":"Child health"},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"Nutrition"},{"type":"h","text":"Vaccination"},{"type":"h","text":"Lifestyle diseases"},{"type":"p","text":"The challenge is to simplify medical information without making it medically inaccurate."}]},{"heading":"Medical Editing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Medical writers can transition into medical editing."},{"type":"h","text":"Medical editor responsibilities"},{"type":"h","text":"Check medical accuracy"},{"type":"h","text":"Improve structure"},{"type":"h","text":"Correct terminology"},{"type":"h","text":"Verify references"},{"type":"h","text":"Identify unsupported claims"},{"type":"h","text":"Ensure consistency"},{"type":"h","text":"Improve readability"},{"type":"h","text":"Check tables/figures"},{"type":"h","text":"Review citations"},{"type":"h","text":"Coordinate author revisions"},{"type":"h","text":"Career progression:"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Writer"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Editor"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Medical Editor"},{"type":"h","text":"Lead Editor"},{"type":"h","text":"Editorial Manager"}]},{"heading":"Pharmaceutical Writing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Pharmaceutical companies offer significant opportunities."},{"type":"h","text":"Possible departments:"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Affairs"},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory Affairs"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Development"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacovigilance"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Communications"},{"type":"h","text":"Publications"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Scientific Affairs"},{"type":"p","text":"An MBBS graduate can develop cross-functional knowledge across these areas."}]},{"heading":"Medical Writing + Pharmacovigilance","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"A particularly useful combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["MBBS","Medical Writing","Drug Safety"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Adverse drug reactions"},{"type":"h","text":"Serious adverse events"},{"type":"h","text":"Safety reporting"},{"type":"h","text":"Signal detection concepts"},{"type":"h","text":"Causality assessment concepts"},{"type":"h","text":"Safety narratives"},{"type":"h","text":"Drug safety terminology"},{"type":"h","text":"This can create opportunities in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmacovigilance companies"},{"type":"h","text":"CROs"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmaceutical companies"},{"type":"h","text":"Drug-safety teams"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical research organizations"}]},{"heading":"Digital & Technology Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Medical writers increasingly work with digital platforms."},{"type":"h","text":"Essential tools"},{"type":"h","text":"Microsoft Word"},{"type":"h","text":"Microsoft PowerPoint"},{"type":"h","text":"Microsoft Excel"},{"type":"h","text":"Google Docs"},{"type":"h","text":"Reference managers"},{"type":"h","text":"PDF annotation tools"},{"type":"h","text":"Literature databases"},{"type":"h","text":"Content management systems"},{"type":"h","text":"Useful advanced skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Data visualization"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic statistics"},{"type":"h","text":"Research databases"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical information systems"},{"type":"h","text":"Structured authoring"},{"type":"h","text":"Document management systems"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic HTML/Markdown"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-assisted writing workflows"}]},{"heading":"AI in Medical Writing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI can significantly improve productivity, but medical writers must remain responsible for the final content."},{"type":"h","text":"Useful applications"},{"type":"h","text":"Literature organization"},{"type":"h","text":"Draft structure generation"},{"type":"h","text":"Summarization"},{"type":"h","text":"Terminology assistance"},{"type":"h","text":"Outline creation"},{"type":"h","text":"Editing"},{"type":"h","text":"Language improvement"},{"type":"h","text":"Translation support"},{"type":"h","text":"Reference organization"},{"type":"h","text":"Table generation"},{"type":"h","text":"Content repurposing"},{"type":"h","text":"Human responsibilities"},{"type":"h","text":"AI Draft"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Verification"},{"type":"h","text":"Evidence Verification"},{"type":"h","text":"Reference Verification"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Context Check"},{"type":"h","text":"Human Editorial Review"},{"type":"h","text":"Final Content"},{"type":"p","text":"Never assume an AI-generated medical statement is correct simply because it sounds clinically plausible."}]},{"heading":"Medical Writing Portfolio","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build a professional portfolio during MBBS."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended portfolio"},{"type":"table","header":["Portfolio Item","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Medical articles"},{"text":"8–10"}],[{"text":"Literature reviews"},{"text":"3–5"}],[{"text":"Patient education articles"},{"text":"3–5"}],[{"text":"Drug monographs"},{"text":"3–5"}],[{"text":"Case report-style documents"},{"text":"2–3"}],[{"text":"Research summaries"},{"text":"5+"}],[{"text":"Scientific slide decks"},{"text":"3"}],[{"text":"Conference poster"},{"text":"1–2"}],[{"text":"Clinical research project"},{"text":"1+"}],[{"text":"Medical infographic"},{"text":"3–5"}],[{"text":"Regulatory writing sample"},{"text":"1–2"}],[{"text":"Publication/manuscript"},{"text":"Ideally 1+"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Avoid using confidential patient information in portfolio samples."}]},{"heading":"Projects During MBBS","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Disease Evidence Review"},{"type":"h","text":"Choose a disease and create:"},{"type":"h","text":"Epidemiology"},{"type":"h","text":"Pathophysiology"},{"type":"h","text":"Diagnosis"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment"},{"type":"h","text":"Guidelines"},{"type":"h","text":"Recent evidence"},{"type":"h","text":"References"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Drug Monograph"},{"type":"h","text":"Create a structured document covering:"},{"type":"h","text":"Generic name"},{"type":"h","text":"Mechanism"},{"type":"h","text":"Indications"},{"type":"h","text":"Dosage concepts"},{"type":"h","text":"Contraindications"},{"type":"h","text":"Adverse effects"},{"type":"h","text":"