:"Healthcare website content"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical presentation development"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical video scripts"},{"type":"h","text":"CME content"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical editing"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmaceutical content"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical research documentation support"},{"type":"h","text":"Potential clients:"},{"type":"h","text":"Doctors"},{"type":"h","text":"Hospitals"},{"type":"h","text":"Researchers"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharma companies"},{"type":"h","text":"HealthTech startups"},{"type":"h","text":"Medical publishers"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare agencies"},{"type":"h","text":"Research organizations"}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The future medical writer should understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Generative AI"},{"type":"p","text":"AI-assisted drafting and content transformation."},{"type":"h","text":"Medical knowledge systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Structured medical information and evidence retrieval."},{"type":"h","text":"Digital health"},{"type":"h","text":"Telemedicine"},{"type":"h","text":"Remote monitoring"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital therapeutics"},{"type":"h","text":"Health apps"},{"type":"h","text":"Precision medicine"},{"type":"p","text":"Genomics and personalized treatment create increasing demand for scientific communication."},{"type":"h","text":"Real-world evidence"},{"type":"p","text":"Medical writers increasingly need to understand observational datasets and real-world clinical evidence."},{"type":"h","text":"Automated clinical documentation"},{"type":"p","text":"AI-assisted clinical documentation will increase the importance of medical review and quality control."},{"type":"h","text":"Multimodal medical communication"},{"type":"p","text":"Future medical communication may combine:"},{"type":"h","text":"Scientific Text"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Visualization"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Interactive Content"},{"ty